1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,567
You shrink about 1 cm every single day

2
00:00:03,567 --> 00:00:07,100
The culprit is hiding in your spine

3
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:10,667
23 jelly cushions full of water

4
00:00:10,667 --> 00:00:14,233
All day, gravity squeezes it out

5
00:00:14,233 --> 00:00:17,767
Lie down at night and the squeeze stops

6
00:00:17,767 --> 00:00:21,333
Your discs drink the water back

7
00:00:21,333 --> 00:00:24,900
You are tallest at sunrise

8
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:28,433
No gravity? In space you grow up to 5 cm

9
00:00:28,433 --> 00:00:32,000
Try it: measure tonight, then at sunrise
